title: "Helpful Potato"
abstract: "An unrooted Android phone used as an AI agent's hands and eyes on a separate computer: the phone emulates a keyboard and mouse (Bluetooth HID via Android's BluetoothHidDevice API, or USB HID through a CH9329 serial-to-HID bridge driven from the phone over USB OTG) and its camera captures the computer's screen, controlled from a host over adb. Published as a technical disclosure / defensive publication."
